WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.525
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.795 --> 00:15.865
(Jung Yong Hwa)

3
00:16.095 --> 00:18.165
(Hong Seung Hee)

4
00:19.065 --> 00:21.965
(Lee Yi Kyung)

5
00:23.435 --> 00:25.435
(Park Yu Na)

6
00:36.715 --> 00:39.955
(Oh! My Guard)

7
00:40.085 --> 00:41.555
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

8
00:41.625 --> 00:43.055
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

9
00:45.925 --> 00:47.195
Don't go anywhere anymore.

10
00:49.565 --> 00:50.595
Just stay by my side.

11
01:27.435 --> 01:28.565
The phone is turned off.

12
01:28.565 --> 01:30.335
After the beep, you will be connected to voicemail...

13
01:36.875 --> 01:37.945
Did she just leave?

14
01:40.445 --> 01:41.515
Today, I really...

15
01:42.585 --> 01:44.415
had somewhere I wanted to go together...

16
01:51.495 --> 01:53.395
Goodness! One, two

17
01:53.395 --> 01:59.365
I'm in my dream

18
02:00.465 --> 02:02.265
How long do I have to sing this?

19
02:02.905 --> 02:06.445
Am I a walking motion sickness pill?

20
02:07.875 --> 02:08.875
What else can I do?

21
02:09.445 --> 02:10.915
I only react to your voice.

22
02:11.915 --> 02:13.985
My body only remembers you.

23
02:15.415 --> 02:17.415
Please, just one more song, okay? Just one.

24
02:22.555 --> 02:24.255
If my brother throws up on Ddabong...

25
02:37.835 --> 02:38.835
Is it that hard for you?

26
02:39.675 --> 02:40.675
Can you really not handle it?

27
02:41.505 --> 02:44.775
Then we should go somewhere and take a rest.

28
02:49.185 --> 02:50.285
Even over there.

29
02:51.785 --> 02:54.925
(Green Motel)

30
02:55.325 --> 02:56.355
You...

31
02:58.725 --> 02:59.795
trust me, right?

32
03:11.235 --> 03:12.835
This is the place you wanted to rest at?

33
03:13.405 --> 03:15.975
Well, what kind of place were you imagining?

34
03:18.575 --> 03:20.215
I was not imagining anything.

35
03:21.145 --> 03:23.755
Although, I do have a pretty wild imagination.

36
03:23.915 --> 03:25.215
Since I am always stuck at home,

37
03:25.385 --> 03:27.425
I imagined everything that happens outside.

38
03:27.925 --> 03:30.325
That is why that man always called me Anne of Green Gables...

39
03:33.525 --> 03:38.465
That man? What man? Do you mean Director Han Jung Woo?

40
03:39.605 --> 03:42.365
No, not Director Han.

41
03:44.405 --> 03:46.545
Come to think of it, who was that man?

42
03:51.075 --> 03:53.885
Wait. You said you were stuck at home.

43
03:54.285 --> 03:58.415
- So your... - Me? What do you mean?

44
03:58.815 --> 04:01.685
What? I love wandering around outside as a hobby.

45
04:03.925 --> 04:06.025
Anyway, I finally feel alive.

46
04:09.865 --> 04:10.865
By the way,

47
04:11.435 --> 04:13.235
there is no one at the playground.

48
04:15.405 --> 04:16.835
It was raining until just a moment ago.

49
04:17.605 --> 04:19.405
It is nice that no one recognizes me.

50
04:21.245 --> 04:23.815
But I achieved my dream, so...

51
04:25.115 --> 04:26.715
I have to endure that kind of inconvenience.

52
04:29.585 --> 04:30.615
By the way,

53
04:31.555 --> 04:33.085
was being an actor always your dream?

54
04:34.085 --> 04:35.525
Not a car designer?

55
04:36.495 --> 04:37.995
That is just a story in a drama.

56
04:38.125 --> 04:40.065
Do you think the me you know is the real me?

57
04:42.495 --> 04:44.395
Rich people must have multiple dreams.

58
04:45.135 --> 04:47.935
I suppose you can achieve them more easily than others.

59
04:49.205 --> 04:50.675
You really do not know anything.

60
04:50.905 --> 04:52.975
I crawled my way up from the very bottom.

61
04:53.105 --> 04:56.045
Things used to never work out for me.

62
04:56.545 --> 04:58.815
I am rookie actor Kim Jae Hee. Thank you.

63
04:58.875 --> 04:59.985
I look forward to working with you.

64
05:02.585 --> 05:04.155
Back when I did not even have a chance,

65
05:05.285 --> 05:06.315
giving up was easy.

66
05:07.255 --> 05:08.925
Let us stop, man.

67
05:09.225 --> 05:10.725
But it turns out...

68
05:11.325 --> 05:13.765
there are many people like me in the world.

69
05:14.625 --> 05:16.365
I gave up on my dream today.

70
05:16.935 --> 05:20.365
Right now, I am the most depressed person in the world.

71
05:27.745 --> 05:30.115
I am more depressed than you.

72
05:30.375 --> 05:32.315
- I do not have a single friend. - I do not have a single friend.

73
05:32.675 --> 05:34.215
Your ID is Ghost?

74
05:35.785 --> 05:37.085
Just because of that?

75
05:38.915 --> 05:41.955
I've only had 3 minor roles in 4 years.

76
05:42.185 --> 05:45.655
I'm just a total loser.

77
05:45.725 --> 05:47.395
(I'm just a total loser)

78
05:50.995 --> 05:54.405
I haven't stepped outside my house in over 15 years.

79
05:54.735 --> 05:56.105
What a load of crap.

80
05:58.835 --> 06:00.745
You're such a liar.

81
06:02.375 --> 06:03.615
It's true.

82
06:04.875 --> 06:05.875
I swear.

83
06:07.315 --> 06:09.215
Are you trying to have a battle...

84
06:09.285 --> 06:10.615
over who has the more depressing life?

85
06:13.455 --> 06:15.425
There are three of us guys...

86
06:15.485 --> 06:19.125
splitting the rent for a rooftop room.

87
06:20.065 --> 06:24.665
I haven't even been to school since the second grade.

88
06:24.965 --> 06:26.635
Today, my profile went straight into the trash...

89
06:26.705 --> 06:29.405
right in front of me.

90
06:30.305 --> 06:34.805
But you probably still have someone who likes you, right?

91
06:39.345 --> 06:43.455
- I don't even have a mom. - Hey, why are you...

92
06:44.815 --> 06:46.485
getting so deep all of a sudden?

93
06:47.485 --> 06:49.755
No one likes me.

94
06:51.125 --> 06:52.195
Not even my dad.

95
06:52.925 --> 06:54.025
That's why...

96
06:58.665 --> 07:01.305
I never smile.

97
07:01.865 --> 07:02.865
What's with her?

98
07:03.875 --> 07:07.105
How is her life a bigger sob story than mine?

99
07:07.705 --> 07:09.475
She's an attention seeker. A total attention seeker.

100
07:14.445 --> 07:18.485
Yes, yes, you win the award for the most depressing life.

101
07:18.555 --> 07:20.755
(Ghost: Yes, yes, you win the award for the most depressing life.)

102
07:22.985 --> 07:25.225
(User: Ghost)

103
07:28.195 --> 07:29.225
Could it be...

104
07:30.895 --> 07:31.995
true?

105
07:39.135 --> 07:40.975
Someone I know once said this.

106
07:41.775 --> 07:45.115
Life is like a box of chocolates.

107
07:45.945 --> 07:48.745
You never know which chocolate you're going to eat first.

108
07:49.045 --> 07:50.155
But one thing is for sure.

109
07:50.885 --> 07:52.885
There are definitely sweet chocolates...

110
07:52.955 --> 07:55.325
in your box too, Ghost.

111
07:55.585 --> 07:58.595
And maybe in mine as well.

112
08:04.265 --> 08:05.495
If you know that,

113
08:06.265 --> 08:07.905
why did you say you were giving up earlier?

114
08:10.305 --> 08:11.675
Who even said that?

115
08:22.085 --> 08:23.315
You're stuck at home,

116
08:23.385 --> 08:24.685
so why aren't you answering your phone?

117
08:24.985 --> 08:27.055
Why are you yelling at me?

118
08:27.225 --> 08:29.455
What, are we having a yelling battle now?

119
08:29.625 --> 08:30.625
What is he talking about?

120
08:32.295 --> 08:33.295
I told you to eat proper meals,

121
08:33.395 --> 08:34.795
but you're sitting there eating raw ramyeon.

122
08:35.465 --> 08:36.595
Seriously...

123
08:37.235 --> 08:38.735
Why is he yelling at me?

124
08:41.805 --> 08:45.135
After that, I visited that cafe a few times,

125
08:47.445 --> 08:48.545
but she never showed up.

126
08:49.245 --> 08:50.345
Do you want to meet her again?

127
08:51.215 --> 08:52.215
I just...

128
08:53.915 --> 08:54.985
think about her sometimes.

129
08:56.345 --> 08:57.355
That Ghost.

130
08:58.455 --> 09:00.885
I wonder if she knows I became an actor.

131
09:01.125 --> 09:02.125
That day...

132
09:04.295 --> 09:06.325
I wonder if she even heard what I said that day.

133
09:07.395 --> 09:08.425
Hello.

134
09:08.565 --> 09:11.165
You received the Brave Citizen Award for this incident.

135
09:11.435 --> 09:13.965
Please look at the camera and say a few words.

136
09:14.665 --> 09:16.165
Aspiring actor Kim...

137
09:18.375 --> 09:20.545
I mean, Um Tae Bong. I will do my best.

138
09:21.675 --> 09:23.745
May I say one more thing?

139
09:24.245 --> 09:27.485
- I really need to be on television. - Yes, please keep it short.

140
09:28.445 --> 09:29.445
Are you watching?

141
09:30.215 --> 09:32.185
Ghost, you are watching, right?

142
09:32.785 --> 09:33.885
I am on television.

143
09:34.355 --> 09:37.325
Therefore, my chocolate is incredibly sweet.

144
09:37.825 --> 09:38.825
How about you?

145
09:39.325 --> 09:42.825
Are you still in that serious mode where you never smile?

146
09:43.125 --> 09:46.535
Soon, you will also be able to eat sweets that knock you out, like me.

147
09:47.035 --> 09:49.565
So smile from now on.

148
09:51.105 --> 09:54.105
Maybe she already knows.

149
09:55.845 --> 09:58.545
Well, I am not that Ghost,

150
10:00.345 --> 10:02.085
but she definitely heard you.

151
10:03.315 --> 10:04.355
And...

152
10:05.315 --> 10:06.355
she probably smiled.

153
10:07.225 --> 10:09.655
When there is no one to see you smile.

154
10:11.255 --> 10:12.995
No one smiles alone.

155
10:13.725 --> 10:15.965
When there is no one to smile with you.

156
10:16.395 --> 10:19.395
And you feel terribly lonely.

157
10:21.505 --> 10:22.705
Maybe at that moment...

158
10:24.405 --> 10:26.075
you were on her side.

159
10:27.345 --> 10:29.775
Think of it as me always watching over you.

160
10:30.445 --> 10:33.145
So now, you have to smile even if you are alone.

161
10:33.245 --> 10:34.545
(Um Tae Bong, 26 Brave Citizen Award)

162
10:35.515 --> 10:36.545
Knowing that somewhere...

163
10:37.815 --> 10:38.985
there is someone on my side.

164
10:41.155 --> 10:43.625
That alone is enough to make you smile again.

165
10:45.225 --> 10:48.495
You asked who said that back then, right?

166
10:49.465 --> 10:50.665
Forrest Gump.

167
10:51.465 --> 10:52.565
His mother.

168
10:55.005 --> 10:56.875
What you gave Ghost that day...

169
10:59.435 --> 11:00.505
was true comfort.

170
11:02.505 --> 11:03.575
I just...

171
11:05.015 --> 11:07.045
said what I wanted to hear myself.

172
11:07.815 --> 11:09.385
Then Ghost, who was right there at that moment,

173
11:09.445 --> 11:11.015
was also comforting you.

174
11:12.015 --> 11:14.385
She made your life, which almost went down the wrong path that day,

175
11:14.485 --> 11:17.295
take a U-turn. Since you know that,

176
11:18.355 --> 11:19.825
why did you say you were giving up earlier?

177
11:27.505 --> 11:29.365
You have to do the same for me.

178
11:30.335 --> 11:32.535
If I am going down the wrong path.

179
11:32.605 --> 11:34.475
But I keep going without realizing it.

180
11:34.545 --> 11:38.975
Then you have to appear right in front of me,

181
11:44.185 --> 11:46.255
so I can return to where I belong.

182
11:48.225 --> 11:49.785
I want you to do that for me too.

183
11:51.995 --> 11:52.995
You will do that, right?

184
11:57.195 --> 12:00.135
Nothing in this world is free. Then give me money. Money.

185
12:00.535 --> 12:01.735
I do not have any.

186
12:02.135 --> 12:05.135
You are just going to exchange it for coins anyway.

187
12:05.935 --> 12:07.645
If you do not give it to me today,

188
12:07.705 --> 12:10.775
- I will bulldoze this place. - Do whatever you want.

189
12:11.045 --> 12:13.415
There is not a single customer today...

190
12:13.815 --> 12:15.315
Wait, there is one.

191
12:16.285 --> 12:18.785
Seriously, give me the money. Money.

192
12:18.855 --> 12:21.855
Sir, give me money.

193
12:22.385 --> 12:24.325
Money.

194
12:25.455 --> 12:26.595
What are you doing right now?

195
12:30.765 --> 12:32.435
That crazy guy from last time?

196
12:32.795 --> 12:34.505
That crazy woman from last time?

197
12:35.465 --> 12:36.535
What, crazy?

198
12:37.505 --> 12:40.035
- Are you talking to me right now? - Are you extorting money here too?

199
12:41.045 --> 12:42.145
What for this time?

200
12:45.375 --> 12:46.715
To be on television over there?

201
12:47.385 --> 12:49.185
No, but why are you extorting money here?

202
12:49.285 --> 12:52.255
Extorting? She is our lord.

203
12:52.885 --> 12:53.885
Lord?

204
12:54.585 --> 12:56.485
Our landlord.

205
12:58.825 --> 13:00.055
Ready, go.

206
13:02.925 --> 13:04.665
But are you really the landlord?

207
13:06.035 --> 13:07.205
None of your business.

208
13:07.305 --> 13:09.335
You have a very unique taste in investments.

209
13:10.335 --> 13:12.335
They said the value would double in just one year.

210
13:13.335 --> 13:16.205
But after selling this to me, the real estate agent ran away.

211
13:17.175 --> 13:19.315
Gosh, dead again.

212
13:20.845 --> 13:22.815
But no one knows there is an arcade in the alley,

213
13:22.885 --> 13:23.885
and no one comes here.

214
13:24.355 --> 13:25.915
Seven, six,

215
13:26.285 --> 13:30.355
- five, four, three... - Behind you.

216
13:40.135 --> 13:41.905
(Tekken King Han Jung Woo Was Here. Oct 7, 2001)

217
13:41.965 --> 13:44.335
Han Jung Woo was here for the last time?

218
13:46.175 --> 13:47.875
I wrote that the day before I immigrated to the UK.

219
13:47.975 --> 13:49.875
Two thousand one?

220
13:51.575 --> 13:52.575
Then for 20 years,

221
13:52.645 --> 13:54.145
this place has not been painted once?

222
13:54.485 --> 13:58.115
I wondered who would buy a building as old as me,

223
13:58.185 --> 14:00.255
and this young celebrity bought it.

224
14:01.885 --> 14:04.525
My life as a landlord is completely ruined.

225
14:04.625 --> 14:07.225
Just stop here for today and go home.

226
14:07.295 --> 14:09.965
You only take a quarter of the rent,

227
14:10.265 --> 14:14.135
and on months with no customers, you change even that into coins...

228
14:14.665 --> 14:19.475
and spend it all here. To help me pay the electric bill.

229
14:20.275 --> 14:21.275
Wait a minute.

230
14:22.675 --> 14:25.445
- Just one more game. - What, one game?

231
14:46.335 --> 14:47.335
Father.

232
14:48.805 --> 14:49.805
I am home.

233
15:02.245 --> 15:04.885
What is it? It is not like you came out to see me off,

234
15:05.385 --> 15:06.915
so you must have something to say. What is it?

235
15:08.025 --> 15:09.485
Cha Hong Du's real family,

236
15:10.825 --> 15:12.155
how is it...

237
15:13.055 --> 15:14.125
that no one is looking for her?

238
15:15.225 --> 15:16.365
They are not looking because no one exists.

239
15:16.425 --> 15:17.465
I looked into it, too.

240
15:17.765 --> 15:20.505
They say her mother passed away a long time ago,

241
15:21.205 --> 15:22.865
and it seems she has a father.

242
15:23.465 --> 15:24.475
To the young lady...

243
15:25.875 --> 15:29.175
- it is as if he does not exist. - I have a bad feeling about it...

244
15:30.105 --> 15:32.045
A normal father would have already been looking for her.

245
15:32.115 --> 15:33.245
And filed a missing person report.

246
15:33.615 --> 15:34.715
What is Cha Hong Du's real name?

247
15:34.715 --> 15:36.185
You will get hurt if you know that.

248
15:37.515 --> 15:38.685
Why is that important?

249
15:38.755 --> 15:40.285
You are not even going to call her by that name.

250
15:43.955 --> 15:45.055
What now?

251
15:48.795 --> 15:49.795
Why are you coming closer?

252
15:50.095 --> 15:51.095
From the beginning...

253
15:52.965 --> 15:54.805
there was no blackmail, was there?

254
16:00.745 --> 16:03.305
Fine, fine, let us say...

255
16:03.505 --> 16:06.675
I lied to you. Are you happy now?

256
16:06.815 --> 16:08.245
Are you a secret donation angel or something?

257
16:08.315 --> 16:10.585
Let us say I also knew about Hong Du's pitiful situation...

258
16:10.655 --> 16:12.515
and did it because I wanted to help her.

259
16:14.025 --> 16:17.425
Okay, okay, I will look for a place for Hong Du to go right now, okay?

260
16:17.725 --> 16:19.255
You cold-hearted jerk.

261
16:20.095 --> 16:21.095
Take your time.

262
16:23.165 --> 16:24.165
There is no rush.

263
16:29.465 --> 16:31.575
Does he think he is Richard Gere? Darn it.

264
16:32.975 --> 16:34.275
He is such a show-off, this punk.

265
16:37.215 --> 16:38.215
Hey.

266
16:40.785 --> 16:43.855
- You should get here earlier. - Su Dong worked hard today too,

267
16:44.115 --> 16:45.455
so let us drink until we drop.

268
16:49.885 --> 16:52.995
Yang Soo Dong, what is it? Why are you in such a good mood?

269
16:55.395 --> 16:57.495
Where did Yang Soo Dong go...

270
16:57.635 --> 16:59.295
after running away from the broadcasting station today?

271
17:04.105 --> 17:06.235
Well, while he was away,

272
17:06.305 --> 17:08.645
I thought I would clean his house for him.

273
17:08.875 --> 17:11.345
- You know? Like a secret helper. - You did?

274
17:11.415 --> 17:12.615
Why has our Ghost not been contacting us...

275
17:12.715 --> 17:15.385
to buy anything lately?

276
17:16.185 --> 17:17.285
Did they stop being a fan?

277
17:21.525 --> 17:23.125
- Mr. Choi Gu? - You thief.

278
17:23.185 --> 17:24.625
There was a rumor that That Person has dementia.

279
17:24.695 --> 17:26.225
So he was staying at Tae Bong's house.

280
17:26.295 --> 17:29.295
And I found a very important...

281
17:29.365 --> 17:32.335
- piece of evidence there. - Evidence?

282
17:32.395 --> 17:34.365
Undeniable evidence that Cha Hong Du...

283
17:34.365 --> 17:36.335
has been going in and out of that house.

284
17:36.835 --> 17:39.405
I mean, ever since she showed up,

285
17:39.505 --> 17:41.545
he told us not to come anywhere near his house.

286
17:41.775 --> 17:45.415
He even goes to the set on his own. She is young, but...

287
17:45.475 --> 17:50.145
she talks down to him all the time. And he only stares at her on set.

288
17:51.285 --> 17:53.655
Putting all of that together,

289
17:55.525 --> 17:57.695
- the two of them are dating. - No way.

290
17:58.195 --> 18:02.095
And that is Um Tae Bong's fatal flaw.

291
18:02.495 --> 18:05.795
- What are you talking about? - He has terrible taste in women.

292
18:06.135 --> 18:08.635
Hey, does she have money or a good education?

293
18:09.105 --> 18:10.105
And that girl has the nerve...

294
18:10.165 --> 18:12.175
to show up acting like a secret bodyguard.

295
18:14.675 --> 18:17.675
Hong Du was a secret bodyguard?

296
18:18.445 --> 18:19.445
That is crazy.

297
18:21.285 --> 18:22.845
So what I mean is...

298
18:23.685 --> 18:26.355
Anyway, that is not what is important.

299
18:26.515 --> 18:29.385
Um Tae Bong has been deceiving Toxic Na Ri all this time...

300
18:29.455 --> 18:30.455
What?

301
18:31.625 --> 18:32.855
Who is deceiving our Na Ri?

302
18:51.545 --> 18:53.175
Why does it have to be my drama?

303
18:58.055 --> 18:59.355
Look at you.

304
19:00.015 --> 19:01.555
I knew you would be like this.

305
19:02.025 --> 19:03.025
Like what?

306
19:03.455 --> 19:05.695
Fine, I will be generous.

307
19:10.225 --> 19:11.235
Here.

308
19:11.965 --> 19:13.765
(Cha Hong Du One-Day Pass)

309
19:13.905 --> 19:16.835
You were holding out here just to get a birthday present.

310
19:17.205 --> 19:18.205
I definitely gave you one.

311
19:18.505 --> 19:20.675
So I will expect one on my birthday too.

312
19:25.145 --> 19:27.945
Wow, does she think she is an amusement park?

313
19:29.915 --> 19:33.885
One, two, three, four...

314
19:34.285 --> 19:37.255
Why did she draw one more than the stars?

315
19:41.465 --> 19:44.335
(Jubong Sweet and Spicy Fried Chicken)

316
19:48.405 --> 19:50.605
The neighborhood where Hae Ra was caught on CCTV,

317
19:50.675 --> 19:52.075
I would like to go there myself.

318
19:52.605 --> 19:53.875
I have not seen her at all since then,

319
19:53.945 --> 19:55.905
so I do not think she is from this neighborhood.

320
19:58.675 --> 19:59.745
Let us go check over there too.

321
20:00.345 --> 20:01.345
Yes, sir.

322
20:05.415 --> 20:07.855
We should head back now. The sun has already set.

323
20:12.095 --> 20:13.095
Chairman Oh.

324
20:16.295 --> 20:17.295
Yes.

325
20:17.535 --> 20:18.865
What brings you to my neighborhood?

326
20:19.195 --> 20:20.835
Was this where you lived, Director Han?

327
20:21.265 --> 20:22.265
Yes.

328
20:22.935 --> 20:25.235
I live in that penthouse over there.

329
20:29.075 --> 20:30.075
Han Jung Woo,

330
20:31.315 --> 20:33.115
why this rooftop apartment of all places?

331
20:38.355 --> 20:39.355
Director Han,

332
20:39.685 --> 20:41.785
are you adjusting well now that you are back in Korea?

333
20:42.285 --> 20:43.525
Yes, I am trying my best.

334
20:44.955 --> 20:47.255
Right, whose side are you on, Director Han?

335
20:48.425 --> 20:50.795
- Excuse me? - There is no need to play innocent.

336
20:50.865 --> 20:52.495
You must have figured it out by now.

337
20:52.565 --> 20:54.505
Whether it is Chairman Oh or Chairman Wang.

338
20:54.805 --> 20:56.005
It is time to pick a side.

339
20:56.365 --> 20:57.905
Well, I...

340
20:57.975 --> 20:59.375
Actually, for this new car promotion,

341
20:59.435 --> 21:01.345
your insight played a big role,

342
21:01.445 --> 21:03.405
and thanks to that, sales have exceeded expectations.

343
21:03.975 --> 21:06.045
Whichever side you choose, Director Han...

344
21:06.545 --> 21:09.845
is now a force the company cannot ignore, right?

345
21:11.385 --> 21:12.455
There is no need to rush.

346
21:12.955 --> 21:14.555
Once the heiress reveals herself to the world,

347
21:14.625 --> 21:16.585
the direction of the wind will change.

348
21:16.785 --> 21:20.195
- We should join forces then. - Of course we should.

349
21:20.595 --> 21:22.595
Eat, eat up.

350
21:23.225 --> 21:24.235
Why...

351
21:25.535 --> 21:26.935
I should be doing that.

352
21:29.235 --> 21:30.405
It is hot.

353
21:31.935 --> 21:34.175
Did you enjoy your meal with the directors?

354
21:34.275 --> 21:35.975
Next time, please make sure to include me...

355
21:36.475 --> 21:38.115
- Yes, I will. - Yes, yes.

356
21:38.175 --> 21:39.175
- Manager Na. - Yes.

357
21:40.515 --> 21:42.285
About our company's heiress.

358
21:43.145 --> 21:44.585
Do you know anything about her?

359
21:49.285 --> 21:51.495
As the best informant in the company,

360
21:52.395 --> 21:54.165
this is a top secret...

361
21:55.895 --> 21:57.865
I heard she is incredibly ugly...

362
21:58.535 --> 21:59.535
What?

363
21:59.595 --> 22:03.205
This is a secret even the directors do not know, yes.

364
22:05.335 --> 22:08.305
That man is Reporter No Tae Hwan.

365
22:08.405 --> 22:10.605
He used to write a lot of articles about our company.

366
22:11.875 --> 22:12.875
Where is he going?

367
22:14.585 --> 22:15.645
No Tae Hwan?

368
22:17.785 --> 22:20.685
(A "Car Doll Keychain" That Did Not Fit the Scene Was Found...)

369
22:20.755 --> 22:22.055
(Reporter No Tae Hwan)

370
22:25.055 --> 22:26.755
- Manager Na, go inside first. - Yes.

371
22:27.095 --> 22:28.165
Excuse me?

372
22:30.165 --> 22:31.265
Excuse me, sir.

373
22:31.935 --> 22:33.535
You are Reporter No Tae Hwan, right?

374
22:34.065 --> 22:36.205
I work at BK, and my name is Han Jung Woo.

375
22:36.665 --> 22:38.635
I read the article you wrote before.

376
22:39.375 --> 22:41.005
About Wang Hui Yeon.

377
22:42.675 --> 22:45.845
Why did you view that accident as a mystery?

378
22:47.815 --> 22:50.185
It is refreshing to hear such a question...

379
22:50.245 --> 22:51.255
from someone at BK.

380
22:54.555 --> 22:55.555
She turned it.

381
22:56.555 --> 22:57.555
Excuse me?

382
22:58.725 --> 23:01.165
That woman turned the steering wheel herself.

383
23:03.095 --> 23:05.195
What do you...

384
23:05.765 --> 23:09.105
It was a fatal accident where she crashed into a parked truck,

385
23:09.305 --> 23:10.535
and someone went to the inquiring reporter...

386
23:10.605 --> 23:12.675
and gave him money.

387
23:13.205 --> 23:14.275
Enough money that he would not have to...

388
23:14.345 --> 23:15.345
work as a reporter anymore.

389
23:17.475 --> 23:20.075
Excuse me, sir. Just one more thing.

390
23:20.145 --> 23:21.345
The car doll keychain...

391
23:21.445 --> 23:23.115
that was found there at the time, right?

392
23:23.185 --> 23:24.215
What did you hear?

393
23:25.285 --> 23:26.485
I told you I received the money.

394
23:27.415 --> 23:29.455
I am the kind of person who earns his keep.

395
23:48.445 --> 23:51.045
Mom!

396
23:55.285 --> 23:56.285
Cha Hong Du.

397
23:58.755 --> 23:59.755
Cha Hong Du.

398
24:31.685 --> 24:34.725
(We Have Noodles)

399
24:38.195 --> 24:40.355
Why are you not answering? Are you mad?

400
24:41.595 --> 24:43.225
(Song Na Ri, Actor and Singer, Country Girls)

401
24:46.265 --> 24:48.865
He was so touched by the arm sleeves I gave him.

402
24:49.435 --> 24:51.275
We look pretty good together.

403
24:53.505 --> 24:54.605
I think I should get going.

404
24:55.305 --> 24:56.305
We can talk later.

405
24:59.645 --> 25:01.685
Did he really go to her yesterday?

406
25:04.685 --> 25:06.155
I thought it was a contract relationship.

407
25:13.825 --> 25:16.025
The number you have reached is not available.

408
25:16.125 --> 25:17.665
After the beep, you will be connected to voicemail...

409
25:20.135 --> 25:23.335
(Are you mad? I just need some air...)

410
25:23.505 --> 25:26.405
- Who did you piss off this time? - Gosh, you startled me.

411
25:27.335 --> 25:29.945
The bad boy concept is only cool in dramas.

412
25:30.005 --> 25:31.175
In reality, it is a total failure.

413
25:31.375 --> 25:33.145
You really cannot tell the difference...

414
25:33.215 --> 25:34.415
between dramas and reality.

415
25:35.045 --> 25:37.915
Wow, look who is talking.

416
25:38.515 --> 25:41.785
But why does your face look like that after a nap?

417
25:42.085 --> 25:45.195
I had a freaking amazing dream. Should I buy a lottery ticket?

418
25:46.255 --> 25:47.255
What dream?

419
25:49.495 --> 25:50.525
A dream where you died.

420
25:50.865 --> 25:53.135
- What? - You got shot to death.

421
25:53.765 --> 25:57.305
What a shame. I should have shot you.

422
25:57.935 --> 25:58.935
Bang.

423
25:59.805 --> 26:01.205
That little...

424
26:03.105 --> 26:05.175
A dream where I get shot to death?

425
26:15.085 --> 26:18.995
Why are all my dreams just one nightmare after another?

426
26:21.525 --> 26:23.695
Anyway, they both leave a bad taste in my mouth.

427
26:31.335 --> 26:34.235
(The Crown Prince's Bodyguard)

428
26:38.975 --> 26:40.545
Han Jung Woo.

429
26:51.295 --> 26:53.325
This was the last scene.

430
26:59.935 --> 27:01.965
That is what I am saying.

431
27:03.035 --> 27:04.035
I know.

432
27:04.105 --> 27:06.675
I know very well that you are Toxic Na Ri's manager.

433
27:06.735 --> 27:09.145
But if Toxic Na Ri finds out about this,

434
27:09.205 --> 27:11.275
she is going to completely lose her mind.

435
27:11.345 --> 27:13.115
(Blank Check)

436
27:16.945 --> 27:17.955
Yes.

437
27:18.015 --> 27:20.415
- No advances on your salary. - That is not it.

438
27:25.195 --> 27:26.225
I am so sorry.

439
27:26.555 --> 27:28.825
- For what? - About Tae Bong and Hong Du dating,

440
27:28.895 --> 27:31.565
I swear I did not intentionally snitch...

441
27:31.635 --> 27:33.995
- to Song Na Ri's manager. - Wait, hold on.

442
27:34.065 --> 27:36.965
- Who is dating who? - Tae Bong and Cha Hong Du.

443
27:37.735 --> 27:40.375
It is an open secret among all of us...

444
27:40.375 --> 27:41.505
No, it is not.

445
27:42.205 --> 27:44.975
CEO Park, do not worry. I will find a way...

446
27:45.045 --> 27:49.345
- to tear them apart somehow. - No, do not do that. Do not.

447
27:49.985 --> 27:51.085
Mom.

448
27:51.655 --> 27:53.515
You know the implant money you mentioned before.

449
27:53.855 --> 27:54.955
Yes, I have it ready.

450
27:57.525 --> 27:59.195
The CEO gave it to me?

451
28:01.295 --> 28:03.225
I wonder why he gave it to me.

452
28:03.925 --> 28:04.935
What?

453
28:06.065 --> 28:07.465
Eyelid surgery?

454
28:09.505 --> 28:11.275
How much is that going to cost?

455
28:12.235 --> 28:13.705
(Blank Check)

456
28:14.005 --> 28:15.405
Let us just keep this one thing, just this.

457
28:18.515 --> 28:19.575
(Do not live like that.)

458
28:20.375 --> 28:22.215
(We will meet, right?)

459
28:22.285 --> 28:23.845
I think we need to find out...

460
28:23.915 --> 28:25.015
if all of these were sent by one person.

461
28:25.215 --> 28:26.285
Right.

462
28:28.325 --> 28:29.955
Yes, thank you. I will call you later.

463
28:31.755 --> 28:33.195
It is your day off, so where are you going?

464
28:35.295 --> 28:36.525
I have nothing to wear.

465
28:37.025 --> 28:39.665
I am going out to buy some clothes and get some fresh air.

466
28:39.965 --> 28:40.965
I will be back.

467
28:42.035 --> 28:43.435
Then will you not go see my brother...

468
28:51.215 --> 28:52.715
I can finally breathe.

469
28:55.815 --> 28:57.045
Are you feeling a bit better?

470
28:57.385 --> 28:59.285
Because I left you like that yesterday,

471
28:59.385 --> 29:01.985
you were a little angry. Our Hyun Joo.

472
29:02.885 --> 29:05.195
Keep looking at me like you are posing for a photoshoot.

473
29:06.125 --> 29:08.665
Then I might just feel like forgiving you.

474
29:10.995 --> 29:13.095
The standard for a photoshoot pose...

475
29:13.695 --> 29:14.705
is this.

476
29:18.575 --> 29:19.575
You smiled.

477
29:22.945 --> 29:24.105
You abandoned me...

478
29:24.175 --> 29:25.915
and had a good time with your girlfriend?

479
29:26.815 --> 29:28.245
I saw Song Na Ri's Instagram.

480
29:30.915 --> 29:31.915
That?

481
29:32.155 --> 29:33.785
This is why only those without someone feel sad.

482
29:34.585 --> 29:37.625
I am starting to get jealous. It makes me want to steal you away.

483
29:38.095 --> 29:39.725
That is the best thing I have heard all day.

484
29:39.955 --> 29:42.625
If I steal you? Will you fall for me?

485
29:44.125 --> 29:45.295
I just might.

486
29:47.335 --> 29:49.005
Then should we start with a kiss?

487
29:49.835 --> 29:51.005
That is the natural order.

488
29:52.535 --> 29:54.275
- Suddenly? - Yes.

489
29:54.905 --> 29:56.105
I said let us try it.

490
29:59.715 --> 30:02.215
You never used to give me an inch,

491
30:02.485 --> 30:03.985
but now you are just throwing yourself at me?

492
30:04.915 --> 30:06.315
Why? Do you hate it?

493
30:09.025 --> 30:10.025
What?

494
30:17.365 --> 30:18.995
There will be no kissing between us.

495
30:19.735 --> 30:20.865
That is...

496
30:21.095 --> 30:22.665
because out of all the ways I express my affection...

497
30:22.735 --> 30:23.865
for you, Hyun Joo,

498
30:24.935 --> 30:26.505
it is the most trivial.

499
30:41.555 --> 30:43.055
My father is going to get even prettier.

500
30:46.195 --> 30:49.265
Father. What was I like when I was young?

501
30:50.065 --> 30:51.495
No matter how hard I try to remember,

502
30:51.635 --> 30:52.895
I cannot remember.

503
30:53.495 --> 30:54.705
Mister.

504
30:55.235 --> 30:57.105
Why do you keep staring at me?

505
30:58.435 --> 30:59.505
I do not like it.

506
30:59.575 --> 31:01.705
Is this the time to worry about my lost memories?

507
31:01.775 --> 31:03.705
Father is always fighting with himself.

508
31:06.145 --> 31:07.145
But Father,

509
31:08.185 --> 31:11.615
to be honest, I am scared to protect Um Tae Bong.

510
31:13.015 --> 31:15.725
I only caught that pickpocket by chance last time.

511
31:15.985 --> 31:18.395
Even in front of that fan who was bothering Song Na Ri,

512
31:18.455 --> 31:19.725
I was actually terrified.

513
31:20.795 --> 31:24.095
I was always brave and courageous,

514
31:24.565 --> 31:25.895
but strangely,

515
31:26.535 --> 31:28.265
it feels like that was not me at all.

516
31:28.565 --> 31:29.765
If...

517
31:29.835 --> 31:32.235
something actually happens to Um Tae Bong...

518
31:34.435 --> 31:36.245
I am afraid I will not be able to do anything.

519
31:37.405 --> 31:39.345
That is what scares me the most, Father.

520
31:40.915 --> 31:41.915
Hey.

521
31:42.115 --> 31:44.955
- What are you doing to his hair? - You are here?

522
31:45.385 --> 31:47.585
I have always been the one to cut my father's hair, why?

523
31:47.655 --> 31:48.825
It looks perfectly fine.

524
31:48.885 --> 31:53.395
- Right, Father? - Chop, chop, what a flop!

525
31:53.455 --> 31:56.125
My hair is uneven!

526
31:58.135 --> 31:59.135
In that case,

527
31:59.195 --> 32:00.695
let's cut this part again. Just here.

528
32:05.605 --> 32:07.735
I might go to the rooftop room this weekend.

529
32:08.105 --> 32:09.445
Do whatever you want.

530
32:09.775 --> 32:12.115
Well, I have some clothes to bring back.

531
32:12.815 --> 32:14.415
You do not even have any clothes to bring.

532
32:14.785 --> 32:16.615
Well, I will not go if you do not want me to.

533
32:17.315 --> 32:18.315
Are you kidding me?

534
32:18.385 --> 32:19.955
"At 3:30 on Wednesday afternoon,"

535
32:20.015 --> 32:21.015
"Han,"

536
32:21.085 --> 32:23.355
"do you want to go ride bikes again this weekend?"

537
32:24.385 --> 32:25.725
Who sent that?

538
32:26.725 --> 32:28.195
I never said that.

539
32:30.125 --> 32:32.695
Just go. Did anyone stop you?

540
32:33.335 --> 32:35.435
Bring me some water first. He is thirsty.

541
32:46.475 --> 32:49.715
Should I try an undercut while we are at it?

542
32:50.715 --> 32:51.715
What do you think, Tae Bong?

543
32:56.655 --> 32:58.595
Sir?

544
33:03.925 --> 33:05.865
While I was out of my mind,

545
33:05.935 --> 33:07.995
I gained another daughter I never had.

546
33:09.865 --> 33:10.865
I am sorry.

547
33:11.335 --> 33:14.175
For bringing you here without asking.

548
33:14.235 --> 33:15.575
No, it is fine.

549
33:16.505 --> 33:18.575
I used to make a living off my face,

550
33:18.645 --> 33:21.715
so thank you for keeping me from looking terrible in public.

551
33:25.655 --> 33:26.715
From now on...

552
33:28.685 --> 33:30.925
things will only get worse, right?

553
33:34.655 --> 33:38.165
If I forget this conversation too...

554
33:40.535 --> 33:41.705
what do I do then?

555
33:44.205 --> 33:45.435
I have done...

556
33:45.975 --> 33:47.535
a great wrong to you, sir.

557
33:47.675 --> 33:49.645
- I will stop. - Do not.

558
33:52.115 --> 33:55.615
Look at her smiling so innocently. Just a few more days.

559
33:56.315 --> 33:57.345
That much...

560
33:58.615 --> 34:00.355
My daughter will understand.

561
34:03.625 --> 34:06.425
("Red Snowman")

562
34:33.155 --> 34:34.455
(Filming The Cocky Detective and Con Artist)

563
34:34.515 --> 34:38.125
Cha Hong Du. You look pretty today.

564
34:39.655 --> 34:41.565
Did you change your makeup?

565
34:41.995 --> 34:44.425
Your clothes look really expensive too.

566
34:47.335 --> 34:49.905
- What body wash do you use? - What?

567
34:50.365 --> 34:52.635
My makeup is a sample Seon Mi gave me.

568
34:53.005 --> 34:54.905
And the neighborhood chief gave me these clothes.

569
34:55.245 --> 34:56.305
I do not use body wash.

570
34:56.675 --> 34:57.705
Really?

571
34:58.545 --> 35:01.415
But the clothes look this good on you?

572
35:01.945 --> 35:04.415
Is it because you have a good figure?

573
35:04.485 --> 35:06.155
Is her shoulder your armrest?

574
35:06.615 --> 35:08.585
I took two days off filming for the commercial.

575
35:08.685 --> 35:09.955
Did you sort out the schedule?

576
35:10.685 --> 35:11.955
Well, not yet...

577
35:12.995 --> 35:14.965
You, go get me some water.

578
35:15.695 --> 35:16.695
Hurry.

579
35:21.165 --> 35:22.165
Hurry up.

580
35:25.635 --> 35:28.075
It is true. Those two have something going on.

581
35:28.645 --> 35:29.645
And they totally pretend they do not.

582
35:29.705 --> 35:31.445
- Um Tae Bong's acting is insane. - Right.

583
35:31.845 --> 35:33.445
No, looking at them again,

584
35:33.515 --> 35:34.945
it seems like they are not even that close.

585
35:35.345 --> 35:36.815
What? You said they seemed to be dating.

586
35:36.885 --> 35:39.215
No, they are not dating. I am absolutely sure.

587
35:39.285 --> 35:41.385
- For real. - As if.

588
35:42.255 --> 35:43.285
What?

589
35:44.325 --> 35:46.125
The next national team gathering is at your restaurant again, right?

590
35:46.195 --> 35:47.425
Hey, let us change the venue for once...

591
35:47.725 --> 35:48.725
Anyway,

592
35:48.865 --> 35:50.395
about the Um Tae Bong case you asked me to look into.

593
35:50.495 --> 35:52.695
That parking lot is a blind spot for the security cameras,

594
35:53.235 --> 35:55.005
so this was caught on another car's dashcam.

595
35:59.675 --> 36:01.775
From now on, only come exactly three times a week.

596
36:01.845 --> 36:02.845
- What? - What?

597
36:05.015 --> 36:06.175
When did he leave?

598
36:07.515 --> 36:10.615
That customer is strange. He just left last time, too.

599
36:13.415 --> 36:15.385
I should have seen this face.

600
37:12.545 --> 37:14.415
Hong Du, I was just about to call you.

601
37:14.545 --> 37:17.045
- Today is the day we ride bicycles. - I am sorry.

602
37:17.115 --> 37:19.315
Um Tae Bong suddenly had a schedule earlier.

603
37:20.455 --> 37:21.725
It cannot be helped.

604
37:22.285 --> 37:24.855
- Work comes first. - Well,

605
37:24.925 --> 37:27.555
I could ditch it if you called me.

606
37:29.795 --> 37:31.225
I think you already ditched it.

607
37:36.265 --> 37:37.335
Here is something warm.

608
37:39.935 --> 37:42.275
Hong Du, I have been wanting to ask you this for a while...

609
37:42.345 --> 37:45.415
do you also like things like a doll keychain?

610
37:46.145 --> 37:47.245
Not really.

611
37:47.445 --> 37:49.545
Only a kid carries things like that around.

612
37:50.045 --> 37:51.245
What about when you were young?

613
37:51.715 --> 37:53.615
When you were about 8 or 9 years old?

614
37:54.315 --> 37:55.925
Like a car keychain...

615
37:59.355 --> 38:01.925
Never mind. Give it to me.

616
38:02.625 --> 38:04.665
If you were a girl, you would have liked...

617
38:04.725 --> 38:05.735
pretty dolls more.

618
38:07.265 --> 38:10.505
- That is a gender stereotype. - I am sorry.

619
38:10.905 --> 38:12.275
I went overboard with my kindness.

620
38:13.535 --> 38:16.645
I am generous, so I will understand. By the way,

621
38:16.705 --> 38:19.415
who carried around a car doll keychain?

622
38:20.675 --> 38:22.315
I am curious about that, too.

623
38:24.445 --> 38:25.585
There,

624
38:26.285 --> 38:29.455
it feels like there must have been...

625
38:30.925 --> 38:31.995
someone else there.

626
38:34.025 --> 38:35.095
There?

627
38:37.895 --> 38:41.165
Anyway, what do you like?

628
38:42.235 --> 38:43.235
Me?

629
38:44.365 --> 38:47.135
I just like people.

630
38:47.905 --> 38:48.905
Female people.

631
38:50.305 --> 38:51.345
What kind of female people?

632
38:53.575 --> 38:55.045
Don't tell me...

633
38:55.645 --> 38:57.115
Is it that woman you mentioned last time?

634
38:58.455 --> 39:00.415
I think you called her Oh Hae something.

635
39:00.485 --> 39:02.225
It is a misunderstanding. A total misunderstanding.

636
39:02.685 --> 39:04.125
It does not seem like a misunderstanding.

637
39:04.585 --> 39:06.295
Hong Du, when will you be free again?

638
39:07.055 --> 39:08.795
I told you I can skip work if you want me to, Mr. Han.

639
39:09.565 --> 39:10.595
- Can you really do that? - Yes.

640
39:11.895 --> 39:14.065
The bus is here. I will get going, Mr. Han.

641
39:14.535 --> 39:15.535
Okay.

642
39:32.215 --> 39:33.355
Hoped she'd take the next one.

643
39:36.855 --> 39:37.885
That startled me.

644
39:39.625 --> 39:41.055
She even shot a cosmetics commercial?

645
39:43.195 --> 39:44.725
She must be busy trying to become a building owner.

646
39:46.365 --> 39:47.895
Tae Bong, where is the commercial shoot tomorrow?

647
39:48.665 --> 39:52.405
No one will tell me. I will just send a coffee truck.

648
39:52.605 --> 39:53.675
I mean it.

649
39:53.735 --> 39:57.105
(Toxic Na Ri)

650
40:01.015 --> 40:02.045
I packed the toothpaste and toothbrush.

651
40:02.115 --> 40:03.585
Do I need to pack towels too? How many?

652
40:03.985 --> 40:05.115
Are you going on a school trip?

653
40:05.455 --> 40:06.615
This is my first time on a trip like this.

654
40:06.855 --> 40:08.555
We are going there to work.

655
40:08.825 --> 40:10.355
We shoot the commercial on the first day...

656
40:10.425 --> 40:11.855
and attend a party the next night.

657
40:12.795 --> 40:14.255
I am talking here.

658
40:15.995 --> 40:17.065
For 1 night and 2 days,

659
40:17.125 --> 40:18.125
do I need to pack two sets of clothes?

660
40:18.995 --> 40:19.995
What?

661
40:20.065 --> 40:21.835
Have you not been changing your clothes every day?

662
40:22.865 --> 40:24.435
Is there a time difference since it is out of town?

663
40:24.535 --> 40:25.535
How much?

664
40:26.005 --> 40:27.605
There is no time difference.

665
40:29.945 --> 40:30.945
Unbelievable.

666
40:37.945 --> 40:39.015
Are you really going together?

667
40:41.585 --> 40:43.525
You have been acting a bit strange lately.

668
40:44.425 --> 40:45.955
It seems like you are treating her a lot better.

669
40:47.525 --> 40:48.595
Me?

670
40:48.895 --> 40:50.025
It is strange right now.

671
40:50.825 --> 40:52.795
It is not like you are taking care of a woman you like.

672
40:53.935 --> 40:54.935
Are you crazy?

673
40:55.765 --> 40:58.575
Out of all the actors, she specifically chose...

674
40:58.575 --> 41:00.935
me, so I figured there must be a reason.

675
41:01.275 --> 41:02.345
How should I put it?

676
41:03.475 --> 41:05.415
As someone who has captured women's hearts,

677
41:05.975 --> 41:07.275
it is a sense of responsibility, I guess?

678
41:10.215 --> 41:12.285
- Are you not going? - Yes, I am going.

679
41:12.715 --> 41:13.715
Hurry up and go.

680
41:17.285 --> 41:18.285
What is this?

681
41:20.795 --> 41:22.295
Did you pack everything in our house?

682
41:22.925 --> 41:24.995
I do not think I have packed everything yet.

683
41:26.435 --> 41:27.435
Are you that excited?

684
41:27.735 --> 41:29.065
Yes, I am going to sleep now.

685
41:29.135 --> 41:30.335
I need to sleep early so I can wake up early.

686
41:35.675 --> 41:37.075
My my.

687
42:07.975 --> 42:09.005
What a fuss.

688
42:18.115 --> 42:19.355
You must tell me every move the young lady makes...

689
42:19.415 --> 42:20.485
without leaving anything out.

690
42:25.355 --> 42:26.355
There.

691
42:33.765 --> 42:37.205
Our Tae Bong keeps asking about that person,

692
42:37.265 --> 42:38.565
so I do not know how to answer...

693
42:38.935 --> 42:42.205
Also, Tae Bong is going to a commercial shoot this time,

694
42:42.275 --> 42:43.405
and that person is going with him...

695
42:43.475 --> 42:44.505
Let's have a drink together.

696
42:47.775 --> 42:48.785
Yes, sir.

697
42:51.085 --> 42:52.085
Hello?

698
42:55.115 --> 42:57.755
I informed you that that person is going with him, yes.

699
42:58.425 --> 42:59.555
Done.

700
43:16.775 --> 43:18.175
I think we are short on outfits.

701
43:21.245 --> 43:22.745
It is Mr. Han.

702
43:24.045 --> 43:25.045
Do you know him?

703
43:25.915 --> 43:26.985
He lives next door to me.

704
43:28.515 --> 43:29.825
Why does he live next door to you?

705
43:30.655 --> 43:33.855
Jun Ji Hyun lives next door to me. Gang Dong Won lives two doors down,

706
43:33.925 --> 43:35.595
and Lee Min Ho lives three doors down.

707
43:40.365 --> 43:41.535
Is this the outfit for today?

708
43:42.205 --> 43:43.905
- Yes. - It is pretty.

709
43:48.205 --> 43:49.275
Hello.

710
43:51.275 --> 43:53.545
- You are here too, Hong Du. - Yes.

711
43:53.915 --> 43:56.215
- I am the head stylist. - I see.

712
43:56.715 --> 43:58.315
Let us go to the car to get more outfits.

713
44:02.225 --> 44:03.355
We will meet later.

714
44:07.895 --> 44:08.895
You saw the storyboard, right?

715
44:11.525 --> 44:13.895
It is so cliche.

716
44:14.095 --> 44:17.235
You were acting so confident,

717
44:17.305 --> 44:19.275
so I thought it would be an amazing concept.

718
44:19.335 --> 44:21.635
A commercial that makes you wonder if the client was on drugs,

719
44:22.205 --> 44:23.545
we want to make something like that too.

720
44:23.645 --> 44:25.915
But the actors say they do not want to do that.

721
44:26.815 --> 44:28.515
When we actually propose it, they say it looks cheap,

722
44:28.575 --> 44:30.515
it ruins their image, or it is cliche.

723
44:30.915 --> 44:34.055
Well-known actors can be quite picky.

724
44:39.525 --> 44:40.725
Are we not going to shoot?

725
44:43.465 --> 44:44.495
Keep up the good work, then.

726
44:44.965 --> 44:46.035
I will.

727
44:47.195 --> 44:48.195
Good luck.

728
44:49.865 --> 44:52.005
All right, this time,

729
44:52.075 --> 44:54.005
we will get a tight shot of your hand on the wheel,

730
44:54.835 --> 44:56.205
but the ring stands out too much.

731
44:59.215 --> 45:00.215
Ready for the shoot.

732
45:04.615 --> 45:06.285
He could just put it in his pocket for the shoot.

733
45:06.355 --> 45:07.585
Why did he leave it with me?

734
45:08.485 --> 45:09.725
Am I his storage box?

735
45:13.395 --> 45:14.795
Anyway, it is important to me.

736
45:14.925 --> 45:17.025
I was going to give it...

737
45:18.095 --> 45:19.165
to the first person I ever wanted.

738
45:23.635 --> 45:24.765
He is so petty.

739
45:26.675 --> 45:27.975
I will not wear it.

740
45:29.675 --> 45:30.675
Look at her slacking off.

741
45:30.745 --> 45:33.245
- Hey, Cha Hong Du, come here. - Yes.

742
45:41.415 --> 45:42.485
What is the room number?

743
45:44.485 --> 45:45.925
Great job on the shoot today, everyone.

744
45:46.325 --> 45:47.625
Get some good rest for today.

745
45:47.695 --> 45:49.925
I will see you tomorrow evening at the private party.

746
45:50.925 --> 45:52.265
The commercial team is having a team dinner...

747
45:52.335 --> 45:54.365
- on their way back to Seoul. - I know.

748
45:54.435 --> 45:55.435
It is a shame to just go to sleep.

749
45:55.505 --> 45:56.865
They say if you drink in a place with fresh air,

750
45:56.935 --> 45:58.335
you do not get a hangover.

751
46:00.035 --> 46:01.035
Hong Du,

752
46:01.235 --> 46:02.775
do you want to unpack and come down for a bit?

753
46:03.005 --> 46:05.205
There is a really nice place to take a walk around here.

754
46:05.715 --> 46:08.775
Really? Then give me 10 minutes. No, just 5 minutes.

755
46:09.545 --> 46:10.585
Great job, everyone.

756
46:10.945 --> 46:12.985
Dae-seong, please back up all the edited versions here.

757
46:14.115 --> 46:15.925
When I call you, run over within five seconds.

758
46:16.855 --> 46:19.525
- My working hours are over. - I will pay you overtime.

759
46:19.595 --> 46:21.595
Did you not see me make plans with Mr. Han earlier?

760
46:22.195 --> 46:25.795
Why do you keep calling him that? He is older than you.

761
46:26.335 --> 46:28.765
Close friends can do that. Why?

762
46:29.165 --> 46:30.165
Close?

763
46:31.505 --> 46:32.505
Double.

764
46:32.835 --> 46:35.675
- Triple. - No. Tonight is a night...

765
46:35.745 --> 46:38.445
where promises are more important than money.

766
46:39.015 --> 46:40.015
What night?

767
46:40.615 --> 46:42.245
What are you two going to do this late at night?

768
46:42.315 --> 46:44.515
Do you not feel the danger lurking all around you?

769
46:45.385 --> 46:46.415
You are unbelievable.

770
46:46.985 --> 46:48.015
Wow.

771
47:00.665 --> 47:01.735
Oh my.

772
47:02.465 --> 47:03.535
Do you work here?

773
47:04.235 --> 47:05.405
As you can see.

774
47:05.835 --> 47:07.305
That is great.

775
47:08.105 --> 47:10.375
I am attending the private party,

776
47:11.075 --> 47:12.475
and there is a VIP room, right?

777
47:13.515 --> 47:16.415
Unfortunately, this event is only for customers...

778
47:16.485 --> 47:17.985
who purchased the limited edition new car.

779
47:18.285 --> 47:21.555
What? Limited? How much is it? I will buy it.

780
47:21.915 --> 47:23.085
Call the manager.

781
47:23.685 --> 47:24.725
Director Han,

782
47:25.355 --> 47:26.895
I have finished guiding everyone to their rooms.

783
47:30.125 --> 47:31.725
So you are the manager?

784
47:32.025 --> 47:33.335
As you can see.

785
47:34.635 --> 47:37.265
Um Tae Bong's real girlfriend, Song Na Ri.

786
47:38.405 --> 47:40.275
Probably the one Um Tae Bong sang for that day.

787
47:40.675 --> 47:41.675
Yes.

788
47:42.605 --> 47:43.975
Where is Director Han?

789
47:47.475 --> 47:50.445
Here you are. The view is terrible.

790
47:50.785 --> 47:52.455
Whether you are Mr. Han or Director Han,

791
47:52.515 --> 47:54.785
do not go anywhere and change my room...

792
47:55.315 --> 47:56.555
Tae Bong.

793
47:57.185 --> 47:58.185
You...

794
48:10.665 --> 48:12.535
Now, focus.

795
48:14.175 --> 48:16.605
To celebrate Song Na Ri's birthday that is coming up in four months.

796
48:17.205 --> 48:19.215
- Cheers. - Cheers.

797
48:19.275 --> 48:20.415
- Cheers. - Thank you.

798
48:20.475 --> 48:22.845
- Happy birthday. - Happy birthday, Song Na Ri.

799
48:22.945 --> 48:24.915
You are the best, Tae Bong.

800
48:28.215 --> 48:30.525
Hey. Do you want to die?

801
48:30.755 --> 48:31.755
Drink.

802
48:37.595 --> 48:39.335
I am finally drinking.

803
48:42.095 --> 48:44.365
You should not be drinking. You are Tae Bong's bodyguard.

804
48:44.935 --> 48:45.935
What?

805
48:49.675 --> 48:51.475
You knew?

806
48:51.775 --> 48:53.745
Wow, do you think I am an idiot?

807
48:54.245 --> 48:55.445
I knew it when you fought...

808
48:55.515 --> 48:57.345
that weird fan who grabbed my waist.

809
49:00.455 --> 49:01.915
What?

810
49:02.485 --> 49:04.825
Did everyone know?

811
49:05.485 --> 49:06.795
Seon Mi, you too?

812
49:09.695 --> 49:10.695
Darn it.

813
49:12.935 --> 49:16.405
The whole nation knows. There are no secrets.

814
49:16.535 --> 49:19.335
But anyway, what kind of name is Cha Hong Du?

815
49:19.575 --> 49:21.875
It is exactly like our drama, and the job is exactly the same...

816
49:22.775 --> 49:26.115
Song Na Ri. You like beef jerky starting today.

817
49:28.215 --> 49:29.645
How did you know I like beef jerky?

818
49:29.715 --> 49:31.185
I knew you were the only one who gets me.

819
49:31.385 --> 49:33.715
But Hong Du, being a bodyguard is so cool.

820
49:35.355 --> 49:36.425
It is nothing special.

821
49:37.285 --> 49:38.285
"It is nothing special."

822
49:38.355 --> 49:40.125
Anyway, should I really try drinking this?

823
49:42.365 --> 49:44.295
- I am going to drink it. - Hey, you.

824
49:47.165 --> 49:49.235
- Drink up, drink up. - Now, over there.

825
49:49.405 --> 49:52.035
Songs are the best snacks for drinking.

826
49:52.335 --> 49:53.805
Right, now.

827
49:55.305 --> 49:56.445
Now, first,

828
49:56.905 --> 50:01.075
our model, Um Tae Bong...

829
50:02.915 --> 50:06.015
can sing next time. Yes, then,

830
50:06.555 --> 50:08.315
how about a song from our Director Han?

831
50:11.055 --> 50:12.925
- Singing here... - Pardon?

832
50:12.995 --> 50:13.995
Then I will sing one song.

833
50:17.325 --> 50:18.395
What is this?

834
50:19.025 --> 50:20.035
Right.

835
50:22.835 --> 50:25.065
Even if you show me

836
50:25.405 --> 50:28.335
A smile

837
50:28.535 --> 50:31.145
An empty expression

838
50:31.205 --> 50:34.015
Cannot be hidden

839
50:34.575 --> 50:37.915
Turning around powerlessly

840
50:38.345 --> 50:41.215
Your figure

841
50:42.085 --> 50:43.885
With blurry eyes

842
50:44.225 --> 50:47.525
I just watch

843
50:48.225 --> 50:50.895
I know

844
50:51.265 --> 50:54.035
Our love

845
50:54.565 --> 50:56.435
That this is the end

846
50:56.505 --> 51:01.035
That this is the end

847
51:01.305 --> 51:04.575
Even if we want each other

848
51:04.775 --> 51:07.915
It cannot be forever

849
51:08.045 --> 51:10.415
That flowing

850
51:10.415 --> 51:12.185
- Why? - In front of time

851
51:12.285 --> 51:13.685
Changing your motion sickness pills?

852
51:15.715 --> 51:19.025
As time goes by

853
51:19.495 --> 51:21.725
A heart-bursting

854
51:21.795 --> 51:24.395
I was thinking about it, but I should not.

855
51:24.765 --> 51:29.605
Mr. Han sings too well.

856
51:29.605 --> 51:32.235
Your singing just completely distracts me.

857
51:32.305 --> 51:33.805
There is no time to think.

858
51:33.805 --> 51:36.745
That is perfect for motion sickness.

859
51:39.445 --> 51:41.415
You are insulting me very intelligently.

860
51:42.245 --> 51:43.245
Wow.

861
51:43.515 --> 51:46.785
As time goes by

862
51:47.115 --> 51:51.085
A heart-bursting

863
51:51.455 --> 51:54.495
Yearning heart

864
51:54.795 --> 51:57.825
Even if forgotten

865
51:58.095 --> 52:01.295
Endlessly precious

866
52:01.695 --> 52:05.135
That there was a person

867
52:05.635 --> 52:09.975
Do not forget and

868
52:11.505 --> 52:13.545
Please remember

869
52:15.415 --> 52:17.645
- One more song, one more song. - Okay, okay.

870
52:18.585 --> 52:20.855
Is it finally my turn?

871
52:21.085 --> 52:23.155
- Cheers. - Cheers. Hey, now.

872
52:23.255 --> 52:26.125
- You are so good, Director Han. - I am the style director.

873
52:26.455 --> 52:27.455
A new groom?

874
52:43.945 --> 52:45.375
With your eyes drooping like that.

875
52:46.115 --> 52:47.745
Did you forget I told you not to smile like that?

876
52:48.645 --> 52:50.245
You should smile more yourself.

877
52:50.745 --> 52:52.185
You will not even let me have one drink.

878
52:52.515 --> 52:54.255
Why are you interfering with my drinking?

879
52:55.485 --> 52:56.485
Well, that is...

880
52:58.355 --> 52:59.355
Just give me my ring back.

881
52:59.855 --> 53:00.855
Ring?

882
53:14.175 --> 53:15.635
Think about it carefully.

883
53:15.945 --> 53:18.945
- Where did it go? - Seriously.

884
53:19.275 --> 53:20.975
They say there are a lot of ghosts at the beach.

885
53:21.575 --> 53:22.985
Do you think a ghost took it?

886
53:24.185 --> 53:27.255
Bring that ghost here. So it can take you away.

887
53:30.455 --> 53:31.455
Hey, Um Tae Bong.

888
53:32.485 --> 53:33.495
Darn it.

889
53:33.595 --> 53:35.595
Do I still look like Cha Hong Du to you?

890
53:35.655 --> 53:39.165
- Stop doing that. - You are a grown man.

891
53:44.505 --> 53:45.505
By the way...

892
53:46.575 --> 53:48.835
- About that pretty girl. - Pretty girl?

893
53:50.705 --> 53:52.045
Hyun Joo?

894
53:52.445 --> 53:54.445
Is she someone really special to you?

895
53:57.445 --> 54:00.715
Every time you look at her, your eyes always get so teary.

896
54:01.915 --> 54:02.925
Hyun Joo is...

897
54:03.685 --> 54:06.055
like a splinter stuck under my fingernail.

898
54:07.655 --> 54:09.465
It has been stuck there for so long...

899
54:10.265 --> 54:11.525
that it hurts just to look at it.

900
54:15.295 --> 54:18.435
Wait. Is that not it shining over there?

901
54:22.535 --> 54:23.545
Oh my.

902
54:25.075 --> 54:26.875
- Let us throw this away. - Bring it here.

903
54:26.945 --> 54:28.845
Let us just throw this away instead of the splinter.

904
54:32.755 --> 54:33.755
Hey, darn it.

905
54:35.055 --> 54:36.055
My gosh.

906
54:37.055 --> 54:39.355
Hey, do you know what kind of ring that is?

907
54:39.895 --> 54:40.895
Before I became Um Tae Bong,

908
54:40.955 --> 54:42.895
it was Kim Jae Hee's youth. My youth.

909
54:43.095 --> 54:44.095
Darn it.

910
54:47.895 --> 54:49.035
If words could kill, I'd be dead already.

911
54:49.735 --> 54:50.735
Darn it.

912
54:57.275 --> 54:58.445
(Next-Door Puppy)

913
55:05.115 --> 55:07.285
Hello? Hong Du?

914
55:07.915 --> 55:08.915
She left her phone behind.

915
55:09.725 --> 55:11.985
- Who is... - Tae Bong is not answering.

916
55:14.355 --> 55:16.525
Darn it, did the two of them really disappear together?

917
55:23.935 --> 55:25.165
Who is Kim Jae Hee?

918
55:26.575 --> 55:29.005
What do you mean, who? It is my real name.

919
55:29.375 --> 55:30.405
Is it not Han Jung Woo?

920
55:31.905 --> 55:34.115
Han Jung Woo is...

921
55:35.115 --> 55:36.115
my legal name.

922
55:37.015 --> 55:39.555
Kim Jae Hee follows my mother's last name.

923
55:40.455 --> 55:41.555
So it is my childhood name.

924
55:43.725 --> 55:46.995
They said things would work out if I just changed my name.

925
55:48.155 --> 55:51.765
Um Tae Bong is the name Min Seok came up with.

926
55:53.565 --> 55:55.035
The day I got that name.

927
55:56.505 --> 55:58.835
I even did a news interview,

928
55:59.905 --> 56:01.305
and miraculously, from then on,

929
56:02.175 --> 56:04.105
my life just took off.

930
56:04.645 --> 56:05.775
Took off, my foot.

931
56:05.905 --> 56:07.315
You pass out whenever you kiss someone.

932
56:11.985 --> 56:12.985
Did you hear that?

933
56:16.325 --> 56:19.155
Yes, I actually knew everything.

934
56:19.655 --> 56:21.755
I also knew that you knew.

935
56:22.825 --> 56:25.365
I was really going to pretend I did not know until the end.

936
56:28.895 --> 56:30.505
You are really funny.

937
56:33.405 --> 56:34.405
Well...

938
56:35.135 --> 56:37.305
CEO Park also said you did not blackmail him.

939
56:39.105 --> 56:40.915
But how did you end up like that?

940
56:41.715 --> 56:43.645
That condition where you pass out.

941
56:46.155 --> 56:48.055
You do not have to tell me if you do not want to.

942
56:52.425 --> 56:53.425
Because of...

943
56:54.525 --> 56:55.525
some kiddo.

944
56:57.795 --> 56:58.795
Kiddo?

945
57:00.035 --> 57:02.295
That kiddo's favorite drama was...

946
57:05.205 --> 57:06.305
Autumn in My Heart.

947
57:06.905 --> 57:07.905
Hey, Kid.

948
57:08.635 --> 57:10.845
Did you just move here? Do you want to play with me?

949
57:11.105 --> 57:12.105
What is your name?

950
57:19.855 --> 57:20.855
Cool, right?

951
57:21.315 --> 57:24.025
I am a hero who defeats the bad guys.

952
57:24.185 --> 57:27.255
- Here I come! - It is really poorly made.

953
57:27.995 --> 57:29.765
My doll is much cooler.

954
57:36.805 --> 57:40.175
My dad bought that for me.

955
57:40.505 --> 57:41.805
(Kim Jae Hee's)

956
57:44.505 --> 57:46.845
Hey. Do not cry.

957
57:48.215 --> 57:49.215
Do not cry.

958
57:53.685 --> 57:54.685
Do not cry.

959
58:08.735 --> 58:10.165
I forgive your sins.

960
58:13.175 --> 58:14.505
I forgive your sins.

961
58:16.405 --> 58:17.775
I said I am not crying anymore.

962
58:18.645 --> 58:22.345
Do you think you are Song Hye Kyo? You do not look like her at all.

963
58:22.915 --> 58:23.915
I know that.

964
58:24.515 --> 58:26.455
But I am still going to marry an actor...

965
58:26.515 --> 58:28.155
like Won Bin later, okay?

966
58:28.715 --> 58:30.255
You are so little, but you keep talking down to me.

967
58:32.785 --> 58:34.525
Then later...

968
58:35.425 --> 58:37.795
should I become an actor? I wanted to be a hero.

969
58:49.605 --> 58:51.175
From today, it belongs to Oh Hae Ra.

970
58:53.075 --> 58:55.515
You little boogers.

971
58:56.415 --> 58:58.115
So that was your first kiss?

972
58:58.585 --> 59:00.185
And you were perfectly fine without passing out?

973
59:02.115 --> 59:03.355
Then...

974
59:04.025 --> 59:05.555
if you meet that booger again...

975
59:05.625 --> 59:06.725
and kiss her, there will be no problem.

976
59:06.795 --> 59:07.925
You will not pass out either.

977
59:08.255 --> 59:09.255
I cannot do that.

978
59:09.925 --> 59:11.795
Because she is gone now.

979
59:14.735 --> 59:17.035
I packed everything for the move ages ago.

980
59:17.635 --> 59:19.435
Jae Hee? Do not even get me started.

981
59:19.505 --> 59:21.705
He has been throwing a tantrum for days about moving.

982
59:23.345 --> 59:25.805
That rich house with the big pine tree?

983
59:26.415 --> 59:27.575
Oh, my.

984
59:27.645 --> 59:29.915
I heard their daughter was suffering from an illness.

985
59:30.785 --> 59:33.755
I thought I had not seen her around.

986
59:33.955 --> 59:36.185
The rumor she followed her mom must be true.

987
59:37.585 --> 59:39.055
Right.

988
59:39.755 --> 59:40.755
What a tragedy.

989
01:00:03.485 --> 01:00:04.485
Because of me...

990
01:00:08.185 --> 01:00:09.385
Because of me...

991
01:00:30.705 --> 01:00:31.705
Jae Hee.

992
01:00:32.405 --> 01:00:34.275
Jae Hee, what are you doing? Get in quickly.

993
01:00:37.145 --> 01:00:38.145
Let us go.

994
01:00:41.855 --> 01:00:43.855
I really wanted to say I was sorry,

995
01:00:45.185 --> 01:00:46.185
but I could not.

996
01:00:47.455 --> 01:00:48.455
Forever.

997
01:00:50.295 --> 01:00:52.665
When I got a girlfriend and kissed her,

998
01:00:54.435 --> 01:00:55.635
that was when I first realized it.

999
01:00:57.665 --> 01:01:00.005
Whenever my lips touched someone else's,

1000
01:01:00.935 --> 01:01:02.105
strangely...

1001
01:01:03.445 --> 01:01:05.145
her face would come to mind,

1002
01:01:06.245 --> 01:01:07.445
and oddly enough...

1003
01:01:08.475 --> 01:01:10.045
I could not breathe.

1004
01:01:12.785 --> 01:01:15.315
The hospital said it was a psychological issue,

1005
01:01:16.055 --> 01:01:18.425
but I think it is because I could not say I was sorry.

1006
01:01:20.325 --> 01:01:21.655
Because I was not forgiven.

1007
01:01:42.845 --> 01:01:44.715
I forgive your sins.

1008
01:01:50.485 --> 01:01:52.055
I forgive your sins.

1009
01:02:01.435 --> 01:02:02.435
Why?

1010
01:02:03.035 --> 01:02:04.035
Are you touched?

1011
01:02:07.035 --> 01:02:08.435
Touched, my foot!

1012
01:02:09.375 --> 01:02:11.445
Quoting an old drama line like that.

1013
01:02:12.245 --> 01:02:15.345
I do not know what you did wrong to her,

1014
01:02:15.845 --> 01:02:16.945
but that kiddo...

1015
01:02:18.045 --> 01:02:19.115
has probably forgotten everything.

1016
01:02:26.855 --> 01:02:29.495
She probably forgave you already. You just did not hear it.

1017
01:02:30.495 --> 01:02:33.935
So stop feeling sorry for that kiddo.

1018
01:02:34.065 --> 01:02:36.235
Because I forgave you on her behalf.

1019
01:02:36.905 --> 01:02:39.435
Therefore, you owe me one.

1020
01:02:39.565 --> 01:02:42.575
- So from now on, if it is for me... - Do you...

1021
01:02:43.405 --> 01:02:44.405
mean it?

1022
01:02:49.175 --> 01:02:50.315
You have to do the same for me.

1023
01:02:51.145 --> 01:02:53.315
If I am going down the wrong path.

1024
01:02:53.385 --> 01:02:55.185
But I keep going without realizing it.

1025
01:02:55.255 --> 01:02:57.555
Then you have to appear...

1026
01:02:58.455 --> 01:02:59.655
right in front of me,

1027
01:03:01.155 --> 01:03:03.265
so I can return to where I belong.

1028
01:03:05.195 --> 01:03:06.695
I want you to do that for me too.

1029
01:03:09.935 --> 01:03:13.005
If you go down the wrong path, you want me to help you...

1030
01:03:13.135 --> 01:03:14.775
find your way back to where you belong.

1031
01:03:16.435 --> 01:03:18.545
Right? It is only fair.

1032
01:03:21.345 --> 01:03:23.385
Listen carefully, Cha Hong Du.

1033
01:03:25.845 --> 01:03:27.855
There is something you need to know.

1034
01:03:28.755 --> 01:03:29.755
So...

1035
01:03:31.725 --> 01:03:34.095
pull yourself together and listen.

1036
01:03:38.765 --> 01:03:39.765
You are not Cha Hong Du.

1037
01:03:43.535 --> 01:03:44.535
What?

1038
01:03:44.905 --> 01:03:47.475
Your name and the world you believe in.

1039
01:03:49.945 --> 01:03:51.045
None of it is real.

1040
01:04:08.055 --> 01:04:10.895
(Oh! My Guard)
